<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>RecycleConnect - Services</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Our Services</h1>
        <p>Explore the various ways we help build a sustainable future.</p>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/about">About</a>
        <a href="/services">Services</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">
        <section class="service-section">
            <h2>Our Key Services</h2>
            <div class="services-list">
                <div class="service">
                    <img src="/images/recycling-service.png" alt="Recycling Service">
                    <h3>Recycling Programs</h3>
                    <p>We offer a wide range of recycling programs to help businesses and individuals recycle waste efficiently. Our services include curbside pickup, recycling bins, and more.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="service">
                    <img src="/images/waste-management.png" alt="Waste Management">
                    <h3>Waste Management Solutions</h3>
                    <p>Our waste management solutions help businesses reduce their environmental impact. From waste sorting to disposal, we ensure that waste is handled responsibly.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="service">
                    <img src="/images/environmental-consulting.png" alt="Environmental Consulting">
                    <h3>Environmental Consulting</h3>
                    <p>We provide expert consulting to help businesses optimize their sustainability efforts. Our services include audits, reports, and strategies for reducing waste and improving environmental practices.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="cta-section">
            <h2>Ready to make a difference?</h2>
            <p>Join us today and take part in making the world cleaner and greener! Together, we can change the future.</p>
            <a href="/contact" class="cta-button">Contact Us</a>
